    "body": "There was a data race on the utf8 field between `PyUnicode_SET_UTF8` and `_PyUnicode_CheckConsistency`. Use the `_PyUnicode_UTF8()` accessor, which uses an atomic load internally, to avoid the data race.\n\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-128212 -->\n* Issue: gh-128212\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\n",
